# Hugo build output + transient artifacts. The manual is built into public/ at
# build time and embedded into the daemon; the generated site is NOT committed —
# EXCEPT a placeholder public/index.html, kept so the `manual` package's
# go:embed compiles before Hugo has run (mirrors the SPA dist/index.html
# placeholder). `hugo` overwrites the placeholder with the real page at build
# time; don't commit that overwrite.
/public/*
!/public/index.html
/resources/_gen/
.hugo_build.lock
